    "sub_ename": "DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION AND CLOUD PROJECT MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "首先教授數位轉型與雲端專案管理相關知識，並搭配資訊科技與系統思考等知識，接著讓學生將專案管理理論運用於專案，並使用雲端平台(SharePoint、AWS等軟體工具)，以展現解決問題及進行團隊協同合作的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "First, teach the knowledge of digital transformation and cloud project management, with knowledge of information technology and systems thinking, and then let students apply project management theory to projects, and use cloud platforms (SharePoint, AWS and other software tools) to demonstrate problem solving and Ability to work in teams.",
